    {
      "id": "u_1ffb0bc315217f5bd53e4b65_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "Using Docker, the server can be run on Windows, Linux and macOS devices.",
      "sourceHash": "1ffb0bc315217f5bd53e4b6553ff7ac9585a576b4ab6c7aea0b5de832762f1ae",
      "context": "System Requirements",
      "contextHash": "ac272c8f84973eca9ec80e0499c5a8bfd45e669d5922afffe6131fdc5b9c29b7",
      "status": "translated",
      "active": true,
      "translation": "Dockerを使用することで、サーバーはWindows、Linux、macOSの各デバイスで実行できます。",
      "conditions": {
        "model": "gemini-3.5-flash-lite",
        "promptHash": "716065651310a44dc7b240e50ada9f3b18164cb6a2471ec2ca8dd86023f06415",
        "glossaryHash": "87275a9e032d2599a1276554b41c0fed0509e3ed6ee1594f83705051d453ee50"
      },
      "translatedAt": "2026-11-14T11:28:45.803Z"
    },
    {
      "id": "u_9ed11451c71464a0df027c61_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "Native binaries are provided for Linux x64 and ARM (__TRILIUM_PH_0__).",
      "sourceHash": "9ed11451c71464a0df027c619adaa5d1bd86c3cbad4dc042c5ab7b3f986c481b",
      "context": "System Requirements",
      "contextHash": "ac272c8f84973eca9ec80e0499c5a8bfd45e669d5922afffe6131fdc5b9c29b7",
      "status": "translated",
      "active": true,
      "translation": "Linux x64およびARM向けのネイティブバイナリが提供されています（__TRILIUM_PH_0__）。",
      "conditions": {
        "model": "gemini-3.5-flash-lite",
        "promptHash": "716065651310a44dc7b240e50ada9f3b18164cb6a2471ec2ca8dd86023f06415",
        "glossaryHash": "87275a9e032d2599a1276554b41c0fed0509e3ed6ee1594f83705051d453ee50"
      },
      "translatedAt": "2026-11-14T11:28:45.803Z"
    },
    {
      "id": "u_d425d64f28f2b13d7256011c_0",
      "kind": "h2",
      "source": "Legacy ARM support__TRILIUM_PH_0__",
      "sourceHash": "d425d64f28f2b13d7256011c8d8ebed2db5f3a75fbd02ea39a1963891e16acd3",
      "context": "System Requirements > Legacy ARM support",
      "contextHash": "894e01875b677e9067060e2e17f73341d9d104bdef42701e1cad536d3056913d",
      "status": "translated",
      "active": true,
      "translation": "レガシーARMのサポート__TRILIUM_PH_0__",
      "conditions": {
        "model": "gemini-3.5-flash-lite",
        "promptHash": "716065651310a44dc7b240e50ada9f3b18164cb6a2471ec2ca8dd86023f06415",
        "glossaryHash": "87275a9e032d2599a1276554b41c0fed0509e3ed6ee1594f83705051d453ee50"
      },
      "translatedAt": "2026-11-14T11:28:45.803Z"
    },
    {
      "id": "u_d4a0fe4c24ef0eaae8d044fc_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "The Docker builds also provide __TRILIUM_PH_0__ and __TRILIUM_PH_1__ platforms. These platforms are considered legacy since Trilium uses Node.js version 24 which have __TRILIUM_PH_2__officially downgraded support__TRILIUM_PH_3__ for these platforms to “experimental”.",
      "sourceHash": "d4a0fe4c24ef0eaae8d044fc346cd3fa655de9fced5cde0f77ec2d8254222cc7",
      "context": "System Requirements > Legacy ARM support",
      "contextHash": "894e01875b677e9067060e2e17f73341d9d104bdef42701e1cad536d3056913d",
      "status": "translated",
      "active": true,
      "translation": "Dockerビルドでは、__TRILIUM_PH_0__および__TRILIUM_PH_1__のプラットフォームも提供しています。Triliumで使用しているNode.jsのバージョン24において、これらのプラットフォームのサポートが__TRILIUM_PH_2__公式に「実験的」へダウングレード__TRILIUM_PH_3__されたため、これらのプラットフォームはレガシーとみなされます。",
      "conditions": {
        "model": "gemini-3.5-flash-lite",
        "promptHash": "716065651310a44dc7b240e50ada9f3b18164cb6a2471ec2ca8dd86023f06415",
        "glossaryHash": "87275a9e032d2599a1276554b41c0fed0509e3ed6ee1594f83705051d453ee50"
      },
      "translatedAt": "2026-11-14T11:28:45.803Z"
    },
    {
      "id": "u_4e01666785011f5eea55733f_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "As a result, Trilium needs to use Node.js 22 for these versions. As soon as soon Node.js 22 will no longer be compatible, support for __TRILIUM_PH_0__ and __TRILIUM_PH_1__ will be dropped entirely.",
      "sourceHash": "4e01666785011f5eea55733fe91fdc49faf4b62da49640c64e937fb0ec6ae924",
      "context": "System Requirements > Legacy ARM support",
      "contextHash": "894e01875b677e9067060e2e17f73341d9d104bdef42701e1cad536d3056913d",
      "status": "translated",
      "active": true,
      "translation": "その結果、Triliumではこれらのバージョン向けにNode.js 22を使用する必要があります。Node.js 22との互換性がなくなり次第、__TRILIUM_PH_0__および__TRILIUM_PH_1__のサポートは完全に終了します。",
      "conditions": {
        "model": "gemini-3.5-flash-lite",
        "promptHash": "716065651310a44dc7b240e50ada9f3b18164cb6a2471ec2ca8dd86023f06415",
        "glossaryHash": "87275a9e032d2599a1276554b41c0fed0509e3ed6ee1594f83705051d453ee50"
      },
      "translatedAt": "2026-11-14T11:28:45.803Z"
    },
    {
      "id": "u_49024ca93fe7c0a3c501cb10_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "Regardless of upstream support, these platforms are supported on a best-effort basis and are not officially supported by the Trilium development team. Bug reports are accepted but they will not be treated with priority; contributions are welcome.",
      "sourceHash": "49024ca93fe7c0a3c501cb10a2c5dd53f829a5168b5f0d0f6b7349732ef2d27b",
      "context": "System Requirements > Legacy ARM support",
      "contextHash": "894e01875b677e9067060e2e17f73341d9d104bdef42701e1cad536d3056913d",
      "status": "translated",
      "active": true,
      "translation": "アップストリームのサポート状況に関わらず、これらのプラットフォームはベストエフォートベースでサポートされており、Trilium開発チームによる公式サポートはありません。バグ報告は受け付けますが優先的には扱われません。コントリビューションは歓迎します。",
      "conditions": {
        "model": "gemini-3.5-flash-lite",
        "promptHash": "716065651310a44dc7b240e50ada9f3b18164cb6a2471ec2ca8dd86023f06415",
        "glossaryHash": "87275a9e032d2599a1276554b41c0fed0509e3ed6ee1594f83705051d453ee50"
      },
      "translatedAt": "2026-11-14T11:28:45.803Z"
    }
  ],
